<title>UK: Paribas sets up London securities group.</title>
<headline>Paribas sets up London securities group.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paribas, the international investment bank, said it had established a securities industry group based in London to meet the banking needs of the U.S. securities industry in Europe.</p>
<p>It had appointed Christina Feicht to head the group, named the Securities Industry Group-Europe, a company statement said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Paribas said the group would offer short term loans, letters of credit and committed revolving credit facilities.</p>
<p>The group's long term strategy was to expand the client base to include U.K. and European securities houses, it said.</p>
<p>Prior to her new appointment, Feicht had been a member of Paribas' Securities Industry Group-New York for 12 years.</p>
<p>-- International Bonds Unit, +44-171-542 8663</p>
